OL,3,GNEWSA'We all need to do more green
OL,4,Atherapy for mental health'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn a break between jobs, Jack Widdop
OL,7,Fpauses to chat and reflect on his
OL,8,Fexperience at Fell Lane Allotment.
OL,10,FTwo weeks ago the 21-year-old was
OL,11,Fprescribed time at the site in
OL,12,FKeighley, as part of Bradford District
OL,13,FCare NHS Foundation Trust's green
OL,14,Ftherapy offering.
OL,16,FStanding in the drizzle on a grey
OL,17,FNovember day, he says he found being on
OL,18,Fthe allotment had "instantly" improved
OL,19,Fhis mood.
OL,21,F"I think it's been brilliant," he says.
